+ * D-Bus and no avahi-daemon, so the client library would have nothing to
+ * talk to even if it were linked. Leaving dest untouched is the "not found"
+ * answer -- main.c checks dest[0] and asks for an IP address, which on this
+ * device is supplied by the launcher configuration anyway.
